flowchart LR
    U[Authorized interactive user] --> GUI[Unelevated TaskMan GUI]
    GUI -->|read-only local sampling| TEL[Windows telemetry APIs]
    GUI -->|versioned, bounded local IPC| PIPE[Local-only named pipe]
    PIPE -->|DACL + client PID/path + exact process identity| SVC[TaskMan Core Service]
    SVC -->|allowlisted controls only| CAP[Privileged process/service controls]
    ACL[Admin-protected Program Files binaries] --> GUI
    ACL --> SVC
    PCFG[(SYSTEM/Admin-only broker manifest)] --> SVC
    UCFG[(Per-user GUI config)] <--> GUI

    subgraph UserSession[User-session trust boundary]
      GUI
      TEL
      UCFG
    end
    subgraph IPCBoundary[Authenticated IPC boundary]
      PIPE
    end
    subgraph ServiceBoundary[LocalSystem service boundary]
      SVC
      PCFG
      CAP
    end
